{
  "info": {
    "name": "SOAR - App Feedback (Notifications, Badges, Catalog)",
    "description": "بنود ملاحظات تطبيق الطالب/الأهل ولوحة التحكم.\n\n## الإعداد\n`base_url`، و`student_token` و`parent_token` و`admin_token` (توكن الداشبورد)، و`student_id` (ابن مربوط بالأهل)، و`offer_id`، و`notification_id`.\n\n## ملخص\n- **الإشعارات:** كل إشعار صار إلو `id` و`created_at` و`read_at`، والقائمة من الأحدث للأقدم مع `unread_count`. الإشعارات القديمة (قبل التحديث) معلّمة كمقروءة.\n- **مؤشر جديد:** للأخبار والنتائج، مع نقاط «تمت المشاهدة». قبل أول مشاهدة، الجديد = اللي نزل بعد إنشاء الحساب.\n- **النتائج:** `exam.course.title` و`exam.course.subject.name` بكل المحاولات (طالب وأهل).\n- **العروض:** `courses_count` صحيح، و`courses[]` بالقائمة والتفاصيل مع `teacher` و`subject`.\n- **الاشتراك:** توكن الأهل ← 403 «الاشتراك يتم من حساب الطالب».\n- **الكتالوج:** مرحلة/صف/مادة معطّلة بتخفي كل اللي تحتها من التطبيق دائماً، ومن الداشبورد مع `?active_only=1`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{student_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://api.soaar.tech/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "student_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "parent_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "student_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "offer_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "notification_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - الإشعارات",
      "description": "للطالب والأهل والأدمن (نفس النقاط، كل حساب بيشوف إشعاراتو).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "قائمة الإشعارات",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/notifications",
            "description": "مرتّبة من الأحدث للأقدم. `unread_count` جنب `data`:\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"success\", \"data\": [ { \"id\": 12, \"title\": \"...\", \"body\": \"...\", \"type\": \"exam_result\", \"data\": {...}, \"read_at\": null, \"created_at\": \"...\", \"updated_at\": \"...\" } ], \"unread_count\": 3 }\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "عدد غير المقروء",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/notifications/unread-count",
            "description": "لرقم الجرس بدون جلب القائمة: `data.unread_count`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تعليم إشعار كمقروء",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/notifications/{{notification_id}}/read",
            "description": "يرجع `data.notification` و`data.unread_count` الجديد. 404 إذا الإشعار مو إلك."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تعليم الكل كمقروء",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/notifications/read-all",
            "description": "يرجع `data.marked_count` و`data.unread_count = 0`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "إشعارات الأهل",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/notifications",
            "description": "نفس الشكل لحساب الأهل."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - مؤشر جديد",
      "description": "الأخبار والنتائج. `new_count` و`has_new` بيرجعوا بـ `additional_data` لقوائمها، أو كلهن مع بعض من `badges`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "كل المؤشرات (طالب)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/badges",
            "description": "```json\n{ \"notifications_unread_count\": 3, \"news\": { \"new_count\": 1, \"has_new\": true }, \"results\": { \"new_count\": 2, \"has_new\": true } }\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "كل المؤشرات (أهل)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/badges",
            "description": "النتائج لكل ابن:\n```json\n{ \"notifications_unread_count\": 0, \"news\": {...}, \"children\": [ { \"student_id\": 5, \"name\": \"...\", \"results\": { \"new_count\": 1, \"has_new\": true } } ] }\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "الأخبار مع المؤشر",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/news",
            "description": "إذا في توكن: `additional_data: { new_count, has_new }` (الأخبار المفعّلة فقط)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تمت مشاهدة الأخبار",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/news/seen",
            "description": "للطالب والأهل."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تمت مشاهدة النتائج (طالب)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/exam-attempts/seen",
            "description": "النتيجة جديدة لما تتصحّح (MCQ فوراً، الكتابي لما يصححو الأدمن) بعد آخر مشاهدة."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "قائمة الأبناء مع المؤشر",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/parent/children",
            "description": "كل ابن فيه `new_results_count`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تمت مشاهدة نتائج ابن",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/parent/students/{{student_id}}/exam-attempts/seen",
            "description": "لكل ابن لحالو، ومنفصلة عن مشاهدة الطالب نفسو."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 - نتائجي",
      "description": "`exam.course` (`id`، `title`) و`exam.course.subject` (`id`، `name`) بكل محاولة.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "نتائجي",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/exam-attempts",
            "description": "مع `additional_data: { new_count, has_new }`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "نتائج ابن",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/parent/students/{{student_id}}/exam-attempts",
            "description": "مع `additional_data: { new_count, has_new }` لهالابن."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 - العروض",
      "description": "`courses_count` = عدد الدورات الظاهرة، و`courses[]` فيها `teacher` و`subject`. بالتطبيق: الدورات اللي مرحلتها/صفها/مادتها معطّلة ما بتظهر، والعرض اللي ما ضل فيه دورات ما بيظهر.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "قائمة العروض",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/offers",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "تفاصيل عرض",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{student_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/offers/{{offer_id}}",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "عروض الأدمن (إدارة)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/offers",
            "description": "كل العروض وكل دوراتها."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "عروض الأدمن (قائمة منسدلة)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/admin/offers?active_only=1",
            "description": "نفس فلترة التطبيق."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 - الاشتراك من حساب الأهل",
      "description": "مرفوض دائماً.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "طلب اشتراك بتوكن الأهل",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{parent_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/subscription-requests",
            "description": "403:\n```json\n{ \"status\": \"error\", \"message\": \"الاشتراك يتم من حساب الطالب\" }\n```\nونفس الشي لـ `offer-subscription-requests`.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"course_id\": 1\n}"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "06 - الكتالوج والمعطّل",
      "description": "التطبيق (طالب/أهل/ضيف): `categories`، `sub-categories`، `subjects`، `courses`، `exams`، `offers`، `teachers` بترجع بس اللي هو ومرحلتو وصفّو ومادتو مفعّلين.\nالداشبورد: بيشوف الكل (ليقدر يرجّع يفعّل)، ومع `?active_only=1` بيتفلتر متل التطبيق — للقوائم المنسدلة.\n\nتفاصيل دورة معطّلة ← 404، إلا للطالب المشترك فيها. وطلب اشتراك بدورة معطّلة (أو عرض كل دوراتو معطّلة) ← 422.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "المراحل (قائمة منسدلة)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/categories?active_only=1",
            "description": ""
          }
        },
        {
